OL,3,AHenry Nowak's killer has minimum term
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years by Court of
OL,5,AAppeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Court of Appeal judges ruled
OL,8,FVickrum Digwa's prison sentence for the
OL,9,Fmurder of Henry Nowak was unduly
OL,10,Flenient
OL,12,FDigwa was jailed for life with a
OL,13,Fminimum term of 21 years for stabbing
OL,14,Fthe 18-year-old student to death in
OL,15,FSouthampton in December 2025
OL,17,FHe had sought permission to challenge
OL,18,Fthe length of his sentence at the Court
OL,19,Fof Appeal
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
