OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHenry Nowak's killer has minimum term
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years by Court of
OL,5,AAppeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe appeal court judges ruled the
OL,8,Finitial sentence "did not adequately
OL,9,Freflect the overall seriousness of the
OL,10,Fmurder"
OL,12,FHis minimum 21-year prison sentence was
OL,13,Fquashed and increased to 25 years
OL,15,FJonathan Polnay KC, for the Attorney
OL,16,FGeneral, earlier argued Digwa's 21-year
OL,17,Fminimum term was too lenient, citing
OL,18,Fhis use of a large dagger, abusing the
OL,19,Freligious exemption to carry it, and
OL,20,Fhis conduct as Henry Nowak lay dying
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
