OL,3,AHenry Nowak's killer has minimum term
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years by Court of
OL,5,AAppeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FImran Khan KC, for Digwa, had argued
OL,8,Fhis 21-year minimum term was too long,
OL,9,Fsaying the judge counted overlapping
OL,10,Faggravating factors more than once
